C laya3d.verify precision: proof.precision == 1 -- block labelled native defect predictions contain no false positives
C laya3d.verify recall: proof.recall == 1 -- block labelled supported defects are found
C laya3d.verify rollback: proof.rollback == true -- block silhouette regression restores exact geometry
C laya3d.verify improvement: proof.improved > 0 -- block actual shared-core fixes remove findings
C laya3d.verify silhouette: proof.silhouettePreserved == true -- block canonical mask IoU cannot decrease
C laya3d.verify episode: proof.episodes > 0 -- block shared laya_instant receives outcome episodes
C laya3d.verify training: proof.training == false -- block no fitting or consolidation for scene domains
J intent closed|open: "Is this intended to be a closed surface? Open surfaces are not holes by default."
J reference source|parent: "Are masks aligned to the source image in the same orthographic cameras? Parent masks prove preservation only."
F Topology flow, semantic floaters, artistic lighting and unaligned source-image fidelity need independently labelled intent; unknown is never clean.
F UV coverage is mapped surface fraction, stretch is triangle edge anisotropy, and UV area sum is not overlap-free occupancy.
F Texture upscale is native resampling, not recovered high-frequency detail. Roblox execution requires an installed Studio; until then its observer is unexecuted code and no Roblox fact is claimed.
F Godot and Unity apply only engine.scale automatically; missing-collider and broken-reference stay review findings because a collider shape or a reference target is authored intent.
F A floater predicate counts small disconnected surface components, not isolated duplicate points; looseVertices is reported separately.
F Image generation requires scene.improve authorization. scene.transcribe(modelPath) observes the live native program; it never replaces geometry. Refitting uses each supplied view for its facing texture projection and cannot waive any view guard.
M API "scene_core.Adapter transcribe/vocabulary/fixes/checkpoint/restore; shared scene_core.judge and improve own all decisions. Source includes sessionId, domain, targets, renders=true. Budget must guard silhouette_quality:min for Blender." src:"plan 23" state:verified
